  "checks": [
    "The built bundle boots, streams the first chunks and renders",
    "The first-run briefing describes the region that was actually generated",
    "Renders on WebGPU and on the WebGL 2 fallback, to the same picture",
    "The frame keeps the original upbeat range, and each area carries its own tone",
    "Real keyboard input flies the aircraft at a modern gunship cruise and top speed",
    "Movement is screen-relative, and with no aim input the aircraft flies nose-first",
    "The arrow keys aim independently of where the aircraft is flying",
    "The mouse aims: the nose points at the ground under the cursor",
    "Rounds go where the aircraft is pointing, not where it is flying",
    "Holding the descend control puts the aircraft down on its skids, and the rotor winds down",
    "Q puts the pilot out on foot, on the surface, with the camera on them",
    "The pilot walks and runs at human speeds, and the panel reports theirs, not the aircraft",
    "You have to walk back to the aircraft to climb into it",
    "The collective lifts it off again and the rotor comes back up",
    "Water and cliffs refuse a landing, and say why",
    "The camera stays above the ground everywhere, including the highest ground in the region",
    "Nine regions with nine landmarks, and the readout changes as you cross them",
    "Every one of the nine landmarks streams in and builds without error",
    "Eight steps of zoom reach exactly eight times the default view, and the far field fills it",
    "The coarse region mesh hangs below the streamed terrain instead of through it",
    "The region map draws inside a frame budget and repaints cleanly",
    "The region map and the yard open, draw and close on real key presses",
    "The region map pans and zooms through five steps, redrawing the terrain at each scale",
    "All twelve kinds of work reach the board and brief the pilot",
    "Holding the winch key lowers a visible cable and hook, and releasing raises it",
    "A contract can be flown to completion for money on the built bundle",
    "Progress saves per seed, survives a reload, and the briefing only happens once",
    "The weather complication closes the visibility in and lifts again",
    "Flying the full ten kilometres keeps residency bounded and releases what it builds",
    "No external asset requests and no JavaScript or shader errors"
